<section class="related-detachment" data-detachment="rad-zone-corps">
      <h2>Rad-zone Corps <span class="detachment-dp">2DP</span></h2>
      <div class="related-kind" data-related-kind="stratagems"><section class="detachment-part" id="rad-zone-corps-stratagems" data-track="rad-zone-corps-stratagems"><h3 class="category-title">Stratagems</h3><div class="stratagem-grid"><article class="stratagem surface turn-yours" data-rule-id="stratagem-extinction-order" data-turn="YOUR TURN" data-target="One TECH-PRIEST model from your army and one objective marker within 24&quot; of that model."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="stratagem-extinction-order" data-term-title="Extinction Order" data-term-summary="Rad-Zone Corps – Strategic Ploy Stratagem WHEN: Your Command phase. TARGET: One TECH-PRIEST model from your army and one objective marker within 24&quot; of that model. EFFECT: Roll one D6 for each enemy unit within range of that objective marker. On a 4+, that unit suffers 1 mortal wound and it must take a Battle-shock test.">Extinction Order</button></h3><span class="stratagem-type">Rad-Zone Corps – Strategic Ploy Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your Command phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One TECH-PRIEST model from your army and one objective marker within 24&quot; of that model.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Roll one D6 for each enemy unit within range of that objective marker. On a 4+, that unit suffers 1 mortal wound and it must take a Battle-shock test.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface turn-yours" data-rule-id="stratagem-lethal-dosage" data-turn="YOUR TURN" data-target="One ADEPTUS MECHANICUS unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="stratagem-lethal-dosage" data-term-title="Lethal Dosage" data-term-summary="Rad-Zone Corps – Wargear Stratagem WHEN: Your Shooting phase. TARGET: One ADEPTUS MECHANICUS unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase. EFFECT: Until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by models in your unit have the [LETHAL HITS] ability.">Lethal Dosage</button></h3><span class="stratagem-type">Rad-Zone Corps – Wargear Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your Shooting phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One ADEPTUS MECHANICUS unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by models in your unit have the <button class="term-button" data-term="core-lethal-hits" data-term-title="[LETHAL HITS]" data-term-summary="When an attack with LETHAL HITS scores a Critical Hit, it automatically wounds. No Wound roll is made, so that attack cannot score a Critical Wound." data-full-rule-path="books/core-rules/reader/core-abilities.html#rule-24-23">[LETHAL HITS]</button> ability.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface turn-yours" data-rule-id="stratagem-pre-calibrated-purge-solution" data-turn="YOUR TURN" data-target="One ADEPTUS MECHANICUS unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase. If that unit is BATTLELINE, you can also target one friendly SKITARII unit (excluding BATTLELINE units) within 6&quot; of it."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="stratagem-pre-calibrated-purge-solution" data-term-title="Pre-calibrated Purge Solution" data-term-summary="Rad-Zone Corps – Battle Tactic Stratagem WHEN: Your Shooting phase. TARGET: One ADEPTUS MECHANICUS unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase. If that unit is BATTLELINE, you can also target one friendly SKITARII unit (excluding BATTLELINE units) within 6&quot; of it. EFFECT: Until the end of the phase, each time a model in one of those units makes a ranged attack, if the target of that attack is within your opponent's deployment zone, you can re-roll the Hit roll.">Pre-calibrated Purge Solution</button></h3><span class="stratagem-type">Rad-Zone Corps – Battle Tactic Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your Shooting phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One ADEPTUS MECHANICUS unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase. If that unit is BATTLELINE, you can also target one friendly SKITARII unit (excluding BATTLELINE units) within 6&quot; of it.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the phase, each time a model in one of those units makes a ranged attack, if the target of that attack is within your opponent's deployment zone, you can re-roll the Hit roll.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface turn-yours" data-rule-id="stratagem-aggressor-imperative" data-turn="YOUR TURN" data-target="One SKITARII unit from your army that has not been selected to move this phase. If that unit is BATTLELINE, you can also target one friendly SKITARII unit (excluding BATTLELINE units) within 6&quot; of it."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="stratagem-aggressor-imperative" data-term-title="Aggressor Imperative" data-term-summary="Rad-Zone Corps – Battle Tactic Stratagem WHEN: Your Movement phase. TARGET: One SKITARII unit from your army that has not been selected to move this phase. If that unit is BATTLELINE, you can also target one friendly SKITARII unit (excluding BATTLELINE units) within 6&quot; of it. EFFECT: Until the end of the phase, each time one of those units Advances, do not make an Advance roll for it. Instead, until the end of the phase, add 6&quot; to the Move characteristic of models in that unit.">Aggressor Imperative</button></h3><span class="stratagem-type">Rad-Zone Corps – Battle Tactic Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your Movement phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One SKITARII unit from your army that has not been selected to move this phase. If that unit is BATTLELINE, you can also target one friendly SKITARII unit (excluding BATTLELINE units) within 6&quot; of it.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the phase, each time one of those units Advances, do not make an Advance roll for it. Instead, until the end of the phase, add 6&quot; to the Move characteristic of models in that unit.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface turn-their" data-rule-id="stratagem-bulwark-imperative" data-turn="THEIR TURN" data-target="One SKITARII unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit's attacks. If that unit is BATTLELINE, you can also target one friendly SKITARII unit (excluding BATTLELINE units) within 6&quot; of it."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="stratagem-bulwark-imperative" data-term-title="Bulwark Imperative" data-term-summary="Rad-Zone Corps – Battle Tactic Stratagem WHEN: Your opponent's Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets. TARGET: One SKITARII unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit's attacks. If that unit is BATTLELINE, you can also target one friendly SKITARII unit (excluding BATTLELINE units) within 6&quot; of it. EFFECT: Until the end of the phase, models in those units from your army have a 4+ invulnerable save.">Bulwark Imperative</button></h3><span class="stratagem-type">Rad-Zone Corps – Battle Tactic Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">2CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your opponent's Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One SKITARII unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit's attacks. If that unit is BATTLELINE, you can also target one friendly SKITARII unit (excluding BATTLELINE units) within 6&quot; of it.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the phase, models in those units from your army have a 4+ invulnerable save.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface turn-their" data-rule-id="stratagem-baleful-halo" data-turn="THEIR TURN" data-target="One ADEPTUS MECHANICUS unit from your army (excluding VEHICLE units) that was selected as the target of one or more of that enemy unit's attacks. If that unit is BATTLELINE, you can also target one friendly SKITARII unit (excluding BATTLELINE units) within 6&quot; of it."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="stratagem-baleful-halo" data-term-title="Baleful Halo" data-term-summary="Rad-Zone Corps – Battle Tactic Stratagem WHEN: Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets. TARGET: One ADEPTUS MECHANICUS unit from your army (excluding VEHICLE units) that was selected as the target of one or more of that enemy unit's attacks. If that unit is BATTLELINE, you can also target one friendly SKITARII unit (excluding BATTLELINE units) within 6&quot; of it. EFFECT: Until the end of the turn, each time an attack is made that targets your unit, subtract 1 from the Wound roll.">Baleful Halo</button></h3><span class="stratagem-type">Rad-Zone Corps – Battle Tactic Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">2CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One ADEPTUS MECHANICUS unit from your army (excluding VEHICLE units) that was selected as the target of one or more of that enemy unit's attacks. If that unit is BATTLELINE, you can also target one friendly SKITARII unit (excluding BATTLELINE units) within 6&quot; of it.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the turn, each time an attack is made that targets your unit, subtract 1 from the Wound roll.</p></article></div></section></div>
