eld="target"><b>Target</b><br>One SKITARII unit from your army.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the phase, your unit is eligible to declare a charge in a turn in which it Advanced.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface turn-their" data-rule-id="stratagem-programmed-withdrawal" data-turn="THEIR TURN" data-target="Up to two SICARIAN units from your army, or one SKITARII INFANTRY or SKITARII MOUNTED unit from your army."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="stratagem-programmed-withdrawal" data-term-title="Programmed Withdrawal" data-term-summary="Skitarii Hunter Cohort – Strategic Ploy Stratagem WHEN: End of your opponent's Fight phase. TARGET: Up to two SICARIAN units from your army, or one SKITARII INFANTRY or SKITARII MOUNTED unit from your army. EFFECT: Remove those units from the battlefield and place them into Strategic Reserves. RESTRICTIONS: Each unit targeted with this Stratagem must be more than 3&quot; away from all enemy units.">Programmed Withdrawal</button></h3><span class="stratagem-type">Skitarii Hunter Cohort – Strategic Ploy Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>End of your opponent's Fight phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>Up to two SICARIAN units from your army, or one SKITARII INFANTRY or SKITARII MOUNTED unit from your army.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Remove those units from the battlefield and place them into Strategic Reserves.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="restrictions"><b>Restrictions</b><br>Each unit targeted with this Stratagem must be more than 3&quot; away from all enemy units.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface turn-their" data-rule-id="stratagem-bionic-endurance" data-turn="THEIR TURN" data-target="One SICARIAN, PTERAXII or SYDONIAN unit from your army that was selected as the 